    <briefdescription>
<para>The class <computeroutput><ref refid="classthrust_1_1system_1_1error__category" kindref="compound">error_category</ref></computeroutput> serves as a base class for types used to identify the source and encoding of a particular category of error code. Classes may be derived from <computeroutput><ref refid="classthrust_1_1system_1_1error__category" kindref="compound">error_category</ref></computeroutput> to support categories of errors in addition to those defined in the C++ International Standard. </para>
    </briefdescription>
